      "notes": "Starter demonstration vise: jaw 1, 80 x 18 x 16 mm blank at Y 0 mm, G54. Close the vise on a 20 mm spacer below Z 8 mm. Secure both jaw blanks in place of the hard jaws before facing and cutting the grip recess. Mounting features: two 3 mm holes at local X 20 and 60, Y 3 mm, and 6 mm counterbores, 3 mm deep below the faced top. The holes clear the support ledge; vertical bolts span the gap to the vise base. Use temporary clamps clear of the paths while machining mounting features; spindle stopped and parked before fitting bolts. This demonstration vise uses vertical mounting; adapt hole locations to the actual vise. Keep bolts, clamps and spacer below the cutter paths.",
      "holdingMethod": "vise"
    },
